OL,3,GNEWSABalloons over safari park begin
OL,4,Aaviation spectacle
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 hot air balloons,
OL,7,Fincluding those in the shape of
OL,8,Fanimals, have been flown over a safari
OL,9,Fpark to begin its annual aviation
OL,10,Fspectacle in its anniversary year.
OL,12,FLongleat Safari Park, near Warminster
OL,13,Fin Wiltshire, opened six decades ago in
OL,14,F1966, and it is also 50 years since the
OL,15,Fsite hosted its first ballooning event
OL,16,F- a 24-hour race.
OL,18,FThe first day of its Icons of the Skies
OL,19,Fevent on Friday saw 51 balloons take
OL,20,Foff, the first two being Simbaloo and
OL,21,FAdelaide, the Longleat lion and koala.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
